# Line endings, settled once.
#
# Six files once showed 3,656 insertions and 3,656 deletions — exactly equal,
# across unrelated files — because something on Windows rewrote them CRLF while
# the committed versions are LF. Not one character of content had changed.
# Committing that would have buried the real history under whole-file rewrites
# and destroyed `git blame` on the blog module.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` tells git to store LF and check out LF, so an editor that
# writes CRLF no longer shows up as a diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these — normalising a binary corrupts it.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.epub binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
